<topic template="Default" modified="2025-05-13T14:40:00.040-04:00" lasteditedby="rbwinst" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../helpproject.xsd">
  <title translate="true">Groundwater Transport</title>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1"><text styleclass="Heading1" translate="true">Groundwater Transport</text></para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">Transport of solutes and energy through the groundwater can be simulated with MT3DMS, MT3D-USGS, the Groundwater Transport (GWT)Process of MODFLOW 6 or the Groundwater Energy (GWE) Process of MODFLOW 6. The chemical species and temperature used for transport with all four programs are specified on the </text><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="Chem-Species-(MT3D-and-GWT)" styleclass="Strong" translate="true">Chem Species</link><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true"> pane. Some data sets, such as porosity, are also shared between MT3D, GWT, and GWE. </text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">Data for GWT are specified under </text><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="GWT-Groundwater-Transport" styleclass="Strong" translate="true">GWT: Groundwater Transport</link><text styleclass="Strong" translate="true">.</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">Data for GWE are specified under </text><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="GWE-Groundwater-Energy-Transpo" styleclass="Strong" translate="true">GWE: Groundwater Energy Transport</link><text styleclass="Strong" translate="true">.</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">Data for MT3D are specified under </text><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="MT3DMS" styleclass="Strong" translate="true">MT3DMS or MT3D-USGS</link><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">.</text></para>
  </body>
</topic>
